  "adaptations": [
    "GLES3 syntax to GLES2; clip-space Macroquad vertex attributes; chart time in _BlockTime.",
    "Active/ready/normal/subtract scalar masks packed in RGBA. Displacement uses Macroquad primary Texture; six extra samplers plus two reserved slots fit GLES2 eight-sampler limit.",
    "Explicit texture LOD zero becomes ordinary sampling; imported textures have no mipmaps.",
    "Texture PNG rows match Unity GPU orientation. Original material values and shader arithmetic retained.",
    "Ten touch positions represented as separate vec4 uniforms selected by an equivalent GLES2 helper; Macroquad has no uniform-array descriptor.",
    "Playtest filters normalized native touches through one documented prpr hook. Upstream judgement and score algorithms are retained.",
    "Audio uses sasa one-pole low-pass with measured backend sample rate, 1500 Hz target and 0.1-second transition; Unity DSP waveform identity is not claimed.",
    "Native geometry and easing are shared with phistudio-core for authoring and export; the playback model reexports that implementation.",
    "Optional RGB material variants are generated in memory, with a palette and packed hover mask to retain the eight-sampler limit. Extracted shader files and their hashes are unchanged."
  ],
